  "inShort": "Behind at the close: the playable-slice goal was missed. The devlog supplied no build or five-player notes, leaving both islands, tide changes and co-op unverified. Mia stopped confirming work after week one, so her engineering contribution cannot support the sailing tasks.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtpjxda025k6nz8n9r6jcyi",
      "text": "The public Godot repository matches the promised reference, with demo folders and import instructions. This task is done, but the repository does not prove your playable slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtpjxfc025l6nz8o4bz37a0",
      "text": "The title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny. The video was not watched, so its suitability as an animated style reference remains unverified. The task stays done."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtpjxg0025m6nz8kf8270mn",
      "text": "The opened Wikipedia article explains playtesting and its formats. It closes the reference task, not the goal’s five-player test."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The sprint’s mountain photograph shows no tide or sailing mechanic. The linked film’s title and thumbnail show Big Buck Bunny, not gameplay. Neither verifies the claimed build or advances the playable-slice goal."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "What did the five players actually test, and what did their tests reveal?"
  ]
}

